      "writtenOn": "2016-05-27T00:58:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This gets trickier, because we should probably support the default duty being percent.\n\nMaybe allow float:\n\nectool pwm_set_duty 0 95.3\n\nAnd/or have an option to set as 16-bit\n\nectool pwm_set_duty 0 16bit 62000\n\nIf the EC supports version 1 of the command, convert duty to 16-bit and send.  Else if it supports version 0, convert duty to percent and send.",
